		{
			"id": "0193a000-0000-7000-8000-000000000001",
			"key": "security-basics",
			"revision": 1,
			"kind": "process",
			"title": "Security basics",
			"status": "current",
			"owner_employee_id": "you",
			"team_id": null,
			"project_id": null,
			"overridable": false,
			"body_markdown": "## Purpose\nKeep secrets, credentials and customer data out of code, logs and messages.\n\n## Procedure\n1. Never paste a secret into a task, a message or a commit.\n2. Read credentials only through the office's connections.\n3. Report anything that looks like a leaked secret to the owner at once.\n\n## Review and completion\nA reviewer checks every change for secrets before it is merged.\n",
			"created": {
				"at": "2026-11-02T09:00:00Z",
				"byKind": "employee",
				"byId": "you"
			},
			"updated": {
				"at": "2026-11-15T10:00:00Z",
				"byKind": "employee",
				"byId": "avery"
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "0193a000-0000-7000-8000-000000000002",
			"key": "review-and-merge",
			"revision": 3,
			"kind": "process",
			"title": "Review and merge",
			"status": "current",
			"owner_employee_id": "avery",
			"team_id": null,
			"project_id": null,
			"overridable": true,
			"body_markdown": "## Purpose\nHow a change gets from a task branch into the integration branch.\n\n## Procedure\n1. Keep the change to one task.\n2. Run the project's checks before asking for review.\n3. Ask a teammate who did not write the change to review it.\n\n## Review and completion\nMerged when its checks pass and the reviewer approved it.\n",
			"created": {
				"at": "2026-11-02T09:00:00Z",
				"byKind": "employee",
				"byId": "you"
			},
			"updated": {
				"at": "2026-11-15T10:00:00Z",
				"byKind": "employee",
				"byId": "avery"
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "0193a000-0000-7000-8000-000000000003",
			"key": "code-review",
			"revision": 1,
			"kind": "process",
			"title": "Code review",
			"status": "current",
			"owner_employee_id": "sam",
			"team_id": null,
			"project_id": null,
			"overridable": true,
			"body_markdown": "## Purpose\nWhat a reviewer looks at.\n\n## Procedure\n1. Read the task first, then the change.\n2. Check that every fix has a test.\n3. Say what must change and what is only a suggestion.\n\n## Review and completion\nApprove when nothing must change.\n",
			"created": {
				"at": "2026-11-02T09:00:00Z",
				"byKind": "employee",
				"byId": "you"
			},
			"updated": {
				"at": "2026-11-15T10:00:00Z",
				"byKind": "employee",
				"byId": "avery"
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "0193a000-0000-7000-8000-000000000004",
			"key": "pii-handling",
			"revision": 2,
			"kind": "process",
			"title": "PII handling",
			"status": "current",
			"owner_employee_id": "hana",
			"team_id": null,
			"project_id": null,
			"overridable": false,
			"body_markdown": "## Purpose\nHow personal data is handled, whatever is being built.\n\n## Procedure\n1. Store personal data only where the project's design says.\n2. Never copy personal data into a test or a log.\n\n## Review and completion\nThe people lead reviews any change to where personal data is stored.\n",
			"created": {
				"at": "2026-11-02T09:00:00Z",
				"byKind": "employee",
				"byId": "you"
			},
			"updated": {
				"at": "2026-11-15T10:00:00Z",
				"byKind": "employee",
				"byId": "avery"
			}
		},
